  <questiondescription format="html"><text><![CDATA[<p id="concept">Compound Proportions: filling with an outlet open</p><p id="description">Grade 12 CBE Core 1.3 / Essential 1.2 (C c; E d): Judge a claim about the time to fill a tank with an outlet open, then find the time by subtracting the outlet's rate.</p><p id="edition">Core and Essential</p><p id="provenance">This question is original to this project.</p><p id="citation">INNODEMS CBC Grade 12 Mathematics, first draft by Ben Davies, 2026. Aligned to the KICD Senior School Curriculum Design, Core and Essential Mathematics Grade 12 (draft).</p>]]></text></questiondescription>
